# Everything the build does not need, and a few things it must never receive.
#
# .env first: it holds AUTH_SECRET and would otherwise be baked into an image
# layer, where deleting it later does not remove it.
# Both spellings: `**/` is documented to match zero directories, so `**/.env`
# should cover the root one, but that is not a detail to stake a secret on.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
**/dist
**/build

.git
.github
**/.gitignore

# Uploaded files are a runtime volume, not image content.
.uploads
**/.uploads

# Test output
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/blob-report
**/e2e/.seed.json
**/e2e/.auth.json

**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/.vscode
**/.idea
